  function linkedTimelineEntries(timeline,included=new Set()){if(!timeline?.isMainTimeline)return [];const result=[],seen=new Set();for(const link of timeline.linkedTimelines||[]){if(link.mode!=='events')continue;const source=timelines.find(item=>item.id===link.timelineId);if(!source||source.id===timeline.id)continue;const selected=byOrder(source.events||[]).filter(event=>(link.eventIds||[]).includes(event.id));for(const event of selected){const key=linkedEventKey(source.id,event.id);if(seen.has(key)||included.has(key))continue;seen.add(key);result.push({...event,_sourceTimelineId:source.id,_sourceTimelineName:source.name,_linkedFromMain:true});}}return result;}
  function timelineEventsForDisplay(timeline){
    if(!timeline?.isMainTimeline)return byOrder(timeline?.events||[]).map(event=>({...event,...eventVisualColors(event),_sourceTimelineId:timeline.id,_sourceTimelineName:timeline.name,_linkedFromMain:false}));
    const included=new Set(),ordered=timelineMainOrder(timeline).map(item=>{
      const mainMeta={_mainOrderKey:timelineOrderKey(item),_mainSimultaneousGroup:item.simultaneousGroup||'',_mainSimultaneousLabel:item.simultaneousLabel||''};
      if(item.kind==='event'){
        const event=(timeline.events||[]).find(row=>row.id===item.id);
        return event?{...event,...eventVisualColors(event),...mainMeta,_sourceTimelineId:timeline.id,_sourceTimelineName:timeline.name,_linkedFromMain:false}:null;
      }
      if(item.kind==='linkedEvent'){
        const source=timelines.find(row=>row.id===item.timelineId),event=source?.events?.find(row=>row.id===item.eventId);
        if(!event)return null;
        included.add(linkedEventKey(source.id,event.id));
        return {...event,...eventVisualColors(event),...mainMeta,_sourceTimelineId:source.id,_sourceTimelineName:source.name,_linkedFromMain:true};
      }
      const link=(timeline.linkedTimelines||[]).find(row=>timelineLinkId(row)===item.id),source=timelines.find(row=>row.id===link?.timelineId);
      if(!link||!source)return null;
      const colors=worldColors(source);
      return {id:`timeline-block:${item.id}`,title:link.title?.trim()||source.name,summary:link.note||'',worldName:source.worldName||source.worldNames?.[0]||'',colorA:colors.a,colorB:colors.b,charIds:[],_timelineLinkBlock:true,_timelineLinkId:item.id,_linkedTimelineId:source.id,_sourceTimelineId:source.id,_sourceTimelineName:source.name,_linkedFromMain:true,...mainMeta};
    }).filter(Boolean);
    return [...ordered,...linkedTimelineEntries(timeline,included)];
  }
  function timelineWorldNames(timeline){return [...new Set([...(timeline?.worldNames||[]),timeline?.worldName,factions.find(f=>f.id===timeline?.factionId)?.name,...timelineEventsForDisplay(timeline).map(event=>eventWorldName(event,timeline))].filter(Boolean).map(name=>String(name).trim()).filter(Boolean))];}
  function knownWorldNames(timeline=null){return [...new Set([...factions.map(f=>f.name),...timelines.flatMap(item=>[...(item.worldNames||[]),item.worldName,...timelineEventsForDisplay(item).map(event=>eventWorldName(event,item))]),...(timeline?.worldNames||[]),timeline?.worldName].filter(Boolean).map(name=>String(name).trim()).filter(Boolean))];}
  function groupTimelineEvents(events){const groups=[];for(const event of events){const linkedGroup=String(event._mainSimultaneousGroup||'').trim(),explicit=String(event.simultaneousGroup||'').trim(),when=String(event.when||'').trim(),key=linkedGroup?`main:${linkedGroup}`:explicit?`group:${explicit.toLocaleLowerCase()}`:when?`when:${when.toLocaleLowerCase()}`:`event:${event._sourceTimelineId||''}:${event.id}`,label=linkedGroup?event._mainSimultaneousLabel||'同時發生':explicit||when,previous=groups[groups.length-1];if(previous?.key===key)previous.events.push(event);else groups.push({key,label,events:[event]});}return groups;}
